{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's chaotic. It's mind-bending. It's POLARIBALL! Fast, frenetic arcade action where you're the master of magnetism. Switch up your polarity and spin that dial to guide the energy ball towards the targets. Grab power-ups for big bonuses, and try not to get shredded by the onslaught of spinning sawblades while you keep that timer up through scoring. If you run out of time, get ready to sweat bullets in Sudden Death mode. And hey, if the main game ain't tough enough, we have a series of ball-busting challenges that'll be sure to give you a run for your money. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to find out what will spin faster: the magnets, or your head.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627490?t=1751930240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627490?t=1751930240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/64e5baeaed4e2bb9f889c6d1af0728ea7cca0adc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751930240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/64e5baeaed4e2bb9f889c6d1af0728ea7cca0adc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751930240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's chaotic. It's mind-bending. It's POLARIBALL! Fast, frenetic arcade action where you're the master of magnetism. Switch up your polarity and spin that dial to guide the energy ball towards the targets. Grab power-ups for big bonuses, and try not to get shredded by the onslaught of spinning sawblades while you keep that timer up through scoring. If you run out of time, get ready to sweat bullets in Sudden Death mode. And hey, if the main game ain't tough enough, we have a series of ball-busting challenges that'll be sure to give you a run for your money. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to find out what will spin faster: the magnets, or your head.</p>","developers":["Zion D. Hill"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627490/f44768aa70691d5f365c626b8daee0baec709e20/header.jpg?t=1751930240","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156647,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156647/movie480.mp4?t=1749860533","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156647/movie_max.mp4?t=1749860533"},"name":"Polariball WIP Footage","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156647/adb28d66e817e189d9f35ae41332d027b1bab90d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749860533","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156647/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749860533","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156647/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749860533"}}],"name":"Polariball","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br>